    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-φῠγή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place of refuge</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.46
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχει γὰρ καταφυγὴν θὴρ μὲν πέτραν,
					δοῦλος δὲ βωμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					267
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. σωτηρίας</span> a safe
				<i>retreat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Or.</u>
				724
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδεμίαν ἔχειν κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					14.55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόνην οἴονται κ. εἶναι τοὺς φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1155a12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύριος κ. μου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					17.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινα κ. πεποιῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					4638.29
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen. obj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κακῶν</span>
			<i>refuge from</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				448
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀκουσίων ἁμαρτημάτων κ. εἶναι
					τοὺς βωμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.98
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ποιεῖσθαι εἰς τέκνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					567
				</span></i>
			 (pl.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				1.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηὕρισκον κ. αὑτοῖς εἰς θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					699b
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ εἰς τοὺς νόμους κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Eux.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοὶ πόλις ἐστὶ καὶ κ. καὶ νόμος ὁ
					δεσπότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					581
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>way of escape, excuse</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγάλων ἀδικημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					46.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				54.21
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
